{"ref":"character:christopher-belmont","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Christopher Belmont is a playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. Their starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Jet_Black_Whip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:jet-black-whip"}," ",{"t":"Jet Black Whip","r":"weapon:jet-black-whip"},". He is also eligible to pick ",{"i":"Sprite-Morning_Star.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:morning-star"}," ",{"t":"Morning Star","r":"weapon:morning-star"}," as optional starting weapon."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Christopher"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_CHRISTOPHER"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Christopher_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Jet_Black_Whip.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:jet-black-whip"}," ",{"t":"Jet Black Whip","r":"weapon:jet-black-whip"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Evolve the ",{"t":"Alucart Sworb","r":"weapon:alucart-sworb"},"."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Keygen_Church.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"The Beginning - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["120"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Revival","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+5"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["To unlock Christopher, evolve the ",{"i":"Sprite-Alucart_Sworb.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:alucart-sworb"}," ",{"t":"Alucart Sworb","r":"weapon:alucart-sworb"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Christopher can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"firsttodoittwice\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Christopher starts with +20 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},", +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"},", and +5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Whenever Christopher damages an enemy, there is a 50% chance for ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"}," to be added to ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", and to multiply ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},". Otherwise, nothing happens. Since this is checked every hit, it can rapidly change. Each bonus is independent of the other, and either, both, or neither bonus may be active at a given moment."]},{"k":"p","c":["Christopher can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["There is a random chance for Greed to affect Christopher's Might and/or Armor. They are randomized separately, so one could be affected, or both, or neither. It is re-randomized multiple times every second, and isn't affected by ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},". Each 1% Greed translates to 1% Might, and each 100% Greed translates to +1 Armor."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Christopher_Belmont.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Christopher Belmont's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Christopher_Belmont.gif","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["His unlocking spell is a reference to him being the first person to defeat ",{"t":"Dracula","r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," twice, in ",{"t":"Castlevania: The Adventure","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castlevania:_The_Adventure"}," and ",{"t":"Castlevania II: Belmont's Revenge","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castlevania_II:_Belmont%27s_Revenge"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Christopher Belmont","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Christopher_Belmont"}," at the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}